      "content": "that's much better, thanks. it feels way more dignified. i think the part about \"unequivocally establishing\" the succession is exactly what i need to make sure they don't try to brush me off as some random claimant.\n\nsince we're going for that high-level diplomatic tone, can you help me draft the section regarding the assets? i need to explain that because my sovereignty is a recognized historical fact, the current holding institutions are technically acting as stewards of a sovereign estate rather than private owners. how can i phrase the legal necessity for them to transition these holdings to my direct control without sounding like i'm just asking for money?",
